        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST100SMTSS4, Modern Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe clean lines of this pull make it a very popular choice when dressing up doors. The 1 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Pull is available in either satin or polished stainless steel finishes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. This Modern Stainless Steel Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching\r\n<a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-brass-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst100smtsbr\"><b>1\" Diameter Wasatch Pull in Brass</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-diameter-stainless-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst125smtss4\"><b>1-1/4\" Diameter Wasatch Pull in Stainless Steel</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-diameter-stainless-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst150smtss4\"><b>1-1/2\" Diameter Wasatch Pull in Stainless Steel</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions WST100SMTSS4 1\" Diameter Stainless Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-WST01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262294\"><b>First Impressions WST100SMTSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>WST100012SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST100024SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST100036SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the pull, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
